  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_curb_for_bridles_cb84bf8396fab324941080f85e51700298c98af8567fa0824b275fcabb929ac25a">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a chain or strap passing under the lower jaw of a horse, and fastened to the upper ends of the branches of the bit; used chiefly for checking an unruly horse (OED s.v. curb n. I 1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
